{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18side_level_act18side_04_end","groupId":"act18side","stageId":"act18side_04","title":"惊愕","storyCode":"LE-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"fafcba9c29f3865b74a36176cbf31a2f436c8d9c1c402bfaca92557860242117","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"黑键想要摆脱格特鲁德的控制，却发现自己无处可逃。他刚一回到住处，就因为剧烈的头痛倒下。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g1_gorgeousstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（疯了！她疯了！那可是整整一个区块的人！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（再说，引发这种规模的事件，她以为她能逃得掉吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果我真的听了她的话，到时候她第一个供出来的就是我！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（就算失去这个机会也没什么好可惜的，我还有机会......我还等得起！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（到了......维谢海姆出入登记办公室......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑键正要推开出入登记办公室的门，激烈的头痛差点让他摔倒在地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凭空出现的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"临阵脱逃的懦夫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你来指手画脚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就算死在乌提卡，也不想变成和你一样的杀人犯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凭空出现的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在......害怕......恐惧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凭空出现的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果受困于区区恐惧......你此生都无法重获自由！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凭空出现的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天真的蠢货......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你爱怎么骂就怎么骂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凭空出现的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你以为那个女人能让你从这里顺利离开吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g7_concerthall_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好，这里现在没什么人......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我得再小心一点，免得有人看到我......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（再往前走一点，就能走到移动城市边缘的无人地块......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"难道您想从移动城市边缘跳下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么做确实可以在最短时间内离开维谢海姆，但我非常不推荐这种方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别逼我，格特鲁德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有任何强迫您的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就放我走，现在就从我眼前消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想去哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到音乐会结束之前，维谢海姆都处在移动中，您哪儿也去不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算您冒着生命危险强行离开，也只能进入人迹罕至的荒野。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"进入人迹罕至的荒野......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我宁可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁可死在荒野上，也不在维谢海姆多待一秒钟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全正确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我理解您的心情了，但您能否也冷静一下，听我把话说完呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有什么好说的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您真的想让我在这儿把一切和盘托出吗，我的乌提卡伯爵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌提卡伯爵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用强调我的头衔，我知道你想说什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，我可以保证，在现有条件下，我们的计划仍然可以顺利进行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我们的计划，是你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这样的措辞能让您好受些的话，我没意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩的尘世之音是损坏的，罗德岛还发现了那东西的副作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"损坏的尘世之音能除去另一段尘世之音吗？就算能，罗德岛难道会坐视不理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，白垩的尘世之音仍然能参与共振。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于罗德岛......您以为这是哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是维谢海姆，我的领地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位芙蓉小姐又是个感染者，能让她踏入莱塔尼亚境内，已经是给罗德岛面子了。她除了维谢海姆哪儿也去不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，她只知道您和白垩会引发一些后果，却完全不知道这后果是怎么来的。她没有任何证据。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，您不忍伤害那些与此事毫无瓜葛的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看来，这是一种不必要的怜悯，但如果您确有此意，就更应该按计划行动了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按计划行动，接着让那些感染者送死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来告诉您计划的剩余部分吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您和白垩合奏，除去自己的尘世之音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，我会在音乐厅里引发一定的混乱，您趁乱逃走，我则借机杀死白垩，将他的尸体伪装成您的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为他现在就是夕照区最大的祸害，他不可能不死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能不死——别想唬我，夕照区最大的祸害难道不是你吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前已经说了，夕照区的一切灾祸都来源于白垩体内损坏的尘世之音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"共振加剧了尘世之音能量的泄漏，而这是不可逆的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算您刚刚真的从移动城市上一跃而下，白垩的尘世之音也不会回到一周前那种接近无害的状态了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更重要的是，尘世之音不仅在伤害白垩身边的人，也在伤害他自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他才是你们俩共振最大的受害者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别看他这段时间好像很健康，但那也只是一种看起来更无害的假愈罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩的身体本来已经适应了尘世之音，但最近急剧上升的泄漏强度马上就要让这种危险的平衡崩溃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"估计得乐观一些，他的好日子大概会在两周后结束，成为假愈期结束后急性症状最为剧烈的那个感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了他，也为了夕照区，他最好的下场就是死在合奏之后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这对你，对我，对夕照区，对他自己，都是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我获得了一张随时可以打出的牌，夕照区获得了平静，白垩获得了安宁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而您......您将获得自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌提卡伯爵，莱塔尼亚的合法继承人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王最后的血脉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g7_concerthall_outside"},{"type":"narration","text":"自由。\n自打有记忆以来，我就不曾知晓什么是自由。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可怜的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必多礼，也不必问好，只需听我说即可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然出生在和巫王相距甚远的旁支，但你的确已经是巫王最后的血脉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出于对你个人的怜悯，我不会为难你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅如此，你还将得到你的家族世代相传的封地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你将成为乌提卡的领主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你将学会对自己的领民负责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你将走上一条与你臭名昭著的亲族完全不同的道路——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这样期待着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这是我记忆的起点。\n当时我大概五六岁，之前的事一概记不清，只是模模糊糊地记得，自己好像和一种叫“尘世之音”的怪东西有什么联系，差点没了命。\n盯着眼前洁白的裙摆，我当时满心以为，自己会成为一个默默无闻的小贵族。\n除了偶尔要忍受尘世之音带来的头痛和幻听之外，我将风平浪静地度过余生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面无表情的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伯爵阁下，您应该谨言慎行，不应随意踏出自己的高塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面无表情的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要知道，您的一切都是女皇陛下赐予的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨小慎微的佣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"伯爵阁下，您是不是忘了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨小慎微的佣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"在吃饭之前，您应当赞颂女皇陛下之名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"循规蹈矩的教师","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伯爵阁下，今天我们来学一首新曲子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"循规蹈矩的教师","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这首曲子抒发了贵族们对女皇陛下的感激之情，请您牢记在心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庸庸碌碌的术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"伯爵阁下，您对源石技艺的操控真是高明！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庸庸碌碌的术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"什么，更精细的操作？哈哈，您何必让自己那么累呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"身边的所有人都在竭力限制我的自由，往我的脑子里面灌输对双子女皇的忠诚。\n如果这就是风平浪静的代价，那我可以忍受。\n我忍受了很久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面无表情的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伯爵大人，我开门见山地说吧，您才是莱塔尼亚真正的主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面无表情的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经在您的塔中潜伏了许多年了，想必您也认得我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面无表情的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，您不必说话，您听我说，不必赞同也不必驳斥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面无表情的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，您在畏惧，您不想连现在的生活都失去。但您至少应该知道，那些人究竟怎么看您，想对您做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面无表情的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您一定知道，僭主强加给您的代理正在下面设宴会客。我将把您带到那里，让您知道真相。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前的人拉了我一把，把我从地上拉了起来。\n我手里全是汗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂妄的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好酒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂妄的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"地窖里居然有这种佳酿，我可真没想到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您过奖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乌提卡这穷乡僻壤什么都缺，酿酒的师傅倒是不少。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂妄的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"趁那小子还没长大，咱们可得多喝几桶，不能给他留着！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，这可不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那小子被软禁在这儿好几年了，我正等着什么时候教他喝酒呢。我得往死里灌他，把他灌成一个彻头彻尾的酒鬼。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"我一时有点恍惚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“你将成为乌提卡的领主。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂妄的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗬，原来你还藏着这一手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂妄的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等那小子彻底泡死在酒里，陛下心里的这颗石头——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘘！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂妄的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对对对，我该死、我该死！我自罚一杯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“你将学会对自己的领民负责。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过，这话只在酒桌上说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"绝不能让那小子留下子嗣，这是上头给我的死命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂妄的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然这样，你何不找个药剂师......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那可不成，会留下把柄的。只有让他自甘堕落，我这任务才算圆满完成！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂妄的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"高！实在是高！来，喝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“你将走上一条与你臭名昭著的亲族完全不同的道路。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果我能平平安安地送走那小子，乌提卡就是我的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂妄的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦哦！来，干杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"干杯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凭空出现的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，哈哈哈哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凭空出现的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小子，听见了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凭空出现的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你要的风平浪静的一生！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键先生，黑键先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您直接倒在地上，我差点就要去联系医院了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好些了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于计划......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在不想听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，您随时可以离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别再来找我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个嘛，恕我难以从命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g6_whitehome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎回来——你脸色好差，怎么了，是生病了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这样子可完全不像没事。快上床躺着，我去烧点热水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别客气，爷爷生病时我也是这么照顾他的。你先躺好，其余的事情交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一直不好，我就去找芙蓉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我马上回来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"乌提卡伯爵忍着强烈的头痛，躺倒在简陋的床上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他的意识渐渐模糊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凭空出现的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下贱的蛆虫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凭空出现的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"毁弃自己高贵的血脉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凭空出现的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"自甘堕落的废物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"从遥远的地方传来一阵大提琴声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>......天空湛蓝晴朗 ♪......</i>"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"头痛并未因此缓解，但乌提卡伯爵脑海中的声音被琴声盖了过去。\n他得到了一些宽慰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>......微风轻声歌唱 ♪......</i>\n这段旋律有些熟悉。\n头痛让乌提卡伯爵无法集中注意力，但他仍然觉得，这段旋律在哪里听过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>......河水潺潺流淌 ♪......</i>\n在哪里听过......\n在哪里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>......我的心——</i>"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你先别动。芙蓉刚刚来过了，她看了你的状况，还抽了血。她说你身体上没有大碍，可能是最近操心太多，太过劳累。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（操心......呵......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"刚才的大提琴......是你拉的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......在哪里听到的这段旋律？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也许是小时候听人哼过的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我记不清了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小时候——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是——你是那个——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是？"},{"type":"narration","text":"虚弱的乌提卡伯爵挣扎了几下，终究没能从床上爬起来。\n但那些尘封在脑海中的记忆，却被琴声唤醒，在伯爵眼前一幕幕闪过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
